SUMMARY:Criterion Mobile Closet
DESCRIPTION:11 a.m. – 7 p.m. Friday & Saturday10 a.m. – 3 p.m. Sunday  \n\n\n\nOverview\n\n\n\nPAM CUT x Criterion presents a three-day celebration of film throughout the museum! Join the Criterion Mobile Closet: stocked with more than 1\,700 of the greatest films from around the world\, the Criterion Collection Closet may offer more cinematic inspiration per square foot than any other place on the planet. Filmmakers\, stars\, and creative luminaries of all kinds come to Criterion to champion their favorite films in the popular Criterion Closet Picks video series. In 2024\, Criterion opened the door to everyone by taking the Closet out on the road\, and Portland will be its eighth stop. \n\n\n\nIf you’re planning to join\, please sign up to get important real-time updates on location\, the opening and closing of our line\, logistics\, etc. Signing up does not guarantee entry. \n\n\n\nInquiries about accessibility can be sent to: mobilecloset@criterion.com. You can find more information on the Criterion Mobile Closet FAQs. \n\n\n\n\nSIGN UP\n\n\n\n\n\n	\n	\n\n\n\nRelated\n\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Monterey Pop x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n					\n		\n						\n			\n																	May 23\, 2026 \n			\n						\n							\n										1219 SW Park Ave \n				\n						\n					\n	\n\n\n\n\n			\n			\n							\n		\n		\n		\n		\n			\n							\n											PAM CUT @ The Whitsell\n						 x 											Partner events\n						 x 											Screenings & experiences\n															\n						\n							\n											\n												Paris Is Burning x Criterion												\n									\n						\n							\n										\n														\n								General accessibility							\n						\n										\n				