SUMMARY:Open Studio
DESCRIPTION:The Finley Learning Studio is open for film inspired drop-in artmaking! With the Criterion Mobile Closet open to visitors on the Park blocks\, the Finley offers a space within the museum to gather\, reflect\, and create in response to the film frenzy. \n\n\n\nStoryboard your own scene! Imagine and create a new iconic film still!  \n\n\n\nDrop into the studio any time during our open hours to make and take home your own film-inspired artwork.
